#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A free IBM course on building a foundational understanding of quantum "
"computing, technology, and applications for business."
msgstr ""
"Kursus IBM percuma tentang membina pemahaman asas pengkomputeran kuantum, "
"teknologi, dan aplikasi untuk perniagaan."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Gambaran keseluruhan"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Gambaran keseluruhan {#overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-business-"
"foundations/hero.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![\"Gambar hero\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-business-"
"foundations/hero.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Designed by IBM Quantum&reg; experts, this course covers the essentials of "
"quantum computing and applications for business. Learn about this new "
"computing paradigm, how it works, and its potential to address incredibly "
"complex business problems. Complete the course to earn your IBM Quantum "
"Business Foundations badge.\n"
msgstr ""
"Direka oleh pakar IBM Quantum&reg;, kursus ini merangkumi asas "
"pengkomputeran kuantum dan aplikasi untuk perniagaan. Ketahui tentang "
"paradigma pengkomputeran baru ini, cara ia berfungsi, dan potensinya untuk "
"menangani masalah perniagaan yang sangat kompleks. Tamatkan kursus untuk "
"mendapatkan lencana Asas Perniagaan Kuantum IBM anda.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Exam {#exam}"
msgstr "Peperiksaan {#exam}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To earn your badge for Quantum business foundations, take the exam at "
"IBM&reg; Training linked below. This exam is intended to be taken after "
"reading the lessons in this course. Once you have passed the exam, you will "
"be notified by Credly that you have earned a badge.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk mendapatkan lencana Asas perniagaan kuantum, ambil peperiksaan di "
"IBM&reg; Training yang dipautkan di bawah. Peperiksaan ini dimaksudkan untuk"
" diambil selepas membaca pelajaran dalam kursus ini. Setelah anda lulus "
"peperiksaan, anda akan diberitahu oleh Credly bahawa anda telah memperoleh "
"lencana.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Exam](/learning/courses/quantum-business-foundations/exam)\n"
msgstr "[Peperiksaan](/learning/courses/quantum-business-foundations/exam)\n"

